{%- doc -%}
  The cart at list prices, in paise, as plain text: every line at the higher of its "compare at" price and its price
  before discounts. A sale price (compare at) is not a Shopify discount, so cart.original_total_price leaves it out;
  the price details and the struck-through total start from this number instead, the same one the lines strike through
  (snippets/cart-line).
  The free gift is left out while it is free: the shopper didn't choose it and was never going to pay for it, so it
  is not added in and taken off again. The price details give it a row of its own (snippets/cart-details).

  @example
  {%- capture list_total -%}{%- render 'cart-list-total' -%}{%- endcapture -%}
  {%- assign list_total = list_total | plus: 0 -%}
{%- enddoc -%}
{%- liquid
  assign list_total = 0
  assign gift_variant = settings.gift_product.variants.first.id
  for item in cart.items
    if settings.gift_product != blank and item.variant_id == gift_variant and item.final_line_price == 0
      continue
    endif
    assign each = item.original_price
    if item.variant.compare_at_price > each
      assign each = item.variant.compare_at_price
    endif
    assign line = each | times: item.quantity
    assign list_total = list_total | plus: line
  endfor
  echo list_total
-%}
